id grid-load-alerts
title Grid load alerts from two meters
lang kron
audience grid operators, utilities, regulators
safety advisory
summary Hourly feeder load from SCADA and from smart meters. Overloads both agree on become alerts for an operator; hours where they disagree are held, not guessed.
inputs inputs.txt
step peak kron peak.k out=peak
step overload kron overload.k out=overload evidence labels=hours advisory
draft overload.k Write a KRON (K spelling) program over the inputs scada, meters and limit that returns a 2-row matrix: row 0 counts the sources that say each hour is over the limit, row 1 the sources that say it is not.
